# VulnGuard

VulnGuard is a lightweight OWASP-focused static security scanner for Python applications.

## Features

- OWASP Top 10 mapped rules
- Pattern-based SAST engine
- Ignore comment support (`# vulnguard: ignore`)
- Severity filtering
- JSON reporting
- Excludes virtual environments automatically

## Installation

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install typer pyyaml

